{
  "name": "POLTURN",
  "displayName": "The Turned Official",
  "sourceFile": "POLTURN.txt",
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": 1000,
      "lines": [
        "<ce>      %pcf, there is an office in _region_ that _seat_",
        "<ce>      would rather had our ear than _rival_'s. _official_,",
        "<ce>      the _office_, keeps it. I have here our offer, under",
        "<ce>      seal: what _seat_ will do for _official_ in return",
        "<ce>      for a friend in that post. Put it in _official_'s",
        "<ce>      hands at __official_ within =traveltime_ days and",
        "<ce>      bring me the answer. The _gold_ gold is yours.",
        "<ce>",
        "<ce>      Know this before you answer: this is a political",
        "<ce>      errand, and those set against _seat_ will think",
        "<ce>      the less of you for it: _against_.",
        "<ce>                     Will you carry it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1001,
      "lines": [
        "<ce>      As you wish. _official_ will keep their post either",
        "<ce>               way, for a while yet."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1002,
      "lines": [
        "<ce>      Good. Find _official_ at __official_ in ___official_,",
        "<ce>      and let no one else read what you carry. You have",
        "<ce>      =traveltime_ days. Come back to me with the answer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1003,
      "lines": [
        "<ce>      Has _official_ read our offer yet, %pcf?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1004,
      "lines": [
        "<ce>      _official_ answers to _seat_ now, and no one in",
        "<ce>      _region_ need know it. Well done. Here is your",
        "<ce>                    _gold_ gold."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1005,
      "lines": [
        "<ce>      _official_ breaks the seal and reads a long while.",
        "<ce>      \"Tell _seat_ that it has a friend in the post of",
        "<ce>      _office_. Quietly, mind. I would rather _rival_",
        "<ce>               did not hear of it.\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1010,
      "lines": [
        "%qdt:",
        " _qgiver_ of ___qgiver_ gave me the sealed offer of",
        " _seat_ for _official_, the _office_, to turn",
        " that office from _rival_ to _seat_. I am to put it",
        " in _official_'s hands at __official_ in",
        " ___official_ within =traveltime_ days, then bring",
        " back the answer. Those set against _seat_ will",
        " think the less of me for it: _against_."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1011,
      "lines": [
        "_official_,",
        "   _seat_ is mindful of what you hold in _region_, and",
        " of what it could hold for you. Answer to us, and",
        " your post, your purse and your name will be looked",
        " after better than _rival_ ever thought to.",
        "                        In the name of _seat_"
      ]
    }
  ],
